# ⭐ OPIc Sample Answer - Day24

One thing I remember clearly is my first day at university.

I was really nervous because I didn't know many people, and everything felt unfamiliar.

At the time, I was worried about making friends and getting used to the new environment.

What happened next was actually quite positive.

I started talking to another student who was sitting next to me, and we realized that we had some similar interests.

We became friends and eventually started spending time together between classes.

Looking back, I think I was much more nervous than I needed to be.

That's why I still remember my first day at university.
